{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/cello-taraf-jvc","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":469,"crm_id":"807","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Cello","slug":"cello-taraf-jvc","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","studio"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Taraf","price":588000,"display_price":"588K","lattitude":25.0509652,"longitude":55.197584,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Cello - a stylish project by developer Taraf, located in one of Dubai's fastest growing neighbourhoods, JVC. The development consists of two towers of 21 and 23 floors and offers elegant <strong>studios, luxury 1-3 bedroom apartments and exclusive 4-bedroom penthouses</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>The increased attention to important details and finishes ensures the perfect balance of functionality and ambience in each residence. On-site facilities include children's and adult swimming pools, an outdoor gym, a Zen reading area and a landscaped park with barbecue areas. Inside the buildings, there is an indoor gym as well as a multi-purpose room for impromptu parties with karaoke.</p><p>The JVC neighbourhood is located close to Dubai's main motorways - Al Khail Road and Hessa Street, allowing residents to quickly access the city's main attractions. Dubai Hills Mall is just 10 minutes away, while Dubai Marina, Ain Dubai and Palm Jumeirah are all within 20 minutes. Jumeirah Beach is approximately 25 minutes' drive away and Dubai International Airport is 35 minutes' drive away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/807/images/2024/01/30/6U6Duoof4skuuMmUBomi6fSiNN8Vsao7sxrWI5J2.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/30/6U6Duoof4skuuMmUB